'''Sap''' is a raw resource obtained using [[Sap Extractor]]s. Its primary use is to be refined into [[Refined Eitr]], and is also used for creating certain consumable items.

== Availability ==
* Harvested from [[Ancient Roots]] in the [[Mistlands]] [[Biomes|biome]] using the [[Sap Extractor]].
* Because Sap replenishes over time at each Ancient Root, Sap is a renewable resource.

